sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor U as User/Attacker
    participant MW as Middleware (Rule Engine)
    participant RD as Redis
    participant SVC as SecurityService (Fusion)
    participant AI as Upstream LLM (via MCP/direct)
    participant CH as ChallengeService
    participant LC as LoginController

    U->>MW: POST /login (email, password)
    MW->>RD: GET blocked:ip / blocked:email
    alt already blocked
        MW-->>U: 403 (early-exit, zero AI cost)
    else not blocked
        MW->>RD: GET attack:login:ip / attack:login:email
        alt below both thresholds
            MW->>LC: next()
        else threshold crossed
            MW->>SVC: analyzeLogin(pseudonymised ctx)
            SVC->>AI: prompt (fenced <context>)
            alt AI responds
                AI-->>SVC: JSON {decision, risk_score, ...}
                SVC->>SVC: S = max(S_rule, S_AI) → F1..F5
            else AI down / invalid
                SVC->>SVC: degraded policy (tiered)
            end
            SVC-->>MW: verdict + action
            alt MALICIOUS or S ≥ 80
                MW->>RD: NAT check (SCARD success:emails:ip)
                alt shared NAT
                    MW->>RD: SETEX blocked:email (scope=account)
                    Note over MW,RD: circuit breaker: ≥5 blocked accounts → IP quarantine
                else single user
                    MW->>RD: SETEX blocked:ip (scope=ip)
                end
                MW-->>U: 403 + admin email alert
            else captcha / otp (AI available)
                alt valid token presented
                    MW->>CH: verify(token, answer)
                    CH-->>MW: pass (token consumed)
                    MW->>LC: next()
                else no/expired token
                    MW->>CH: issue (single-use, hashed)
                    MW-->>U: 428 + challenge (OTP never in body)
                end
            else AI-down 50–79 (degraded)
                MW->>RD: INCR mcp:degraded:ip (N-strike)
                alt strike ≥ 3
                    MW-->>U: 429 + 900s block
                else
                    MW->>LC: next() (monitored)
                end
            else SAFE / monitor
                MW->>LC: next()
            end
        end
    end

    LC->>LC: Auth::attempt(email, password)
    alt auth fails
        LC->>RD: atomic Lua INCR+EXPIRE (ip, email)
        LC-->>U: Invalid credentials
    else auth succeeds
        LC->>RD: SADD success:emails:ip + DEL counters/blocks
        LC-->>U: redirect by role
    end
